    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Whenever you use @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.zE1Yr2plIVjWNuWy]{Rejuvenation}, you can expend a spell slot of 1st-level or higher to choose a second target within range and divide the hit points restored between the targets. This does not change the effect of @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.zE1Yr2plIVjWNuWy]{Rejuvenation}.</p><p><strong>At Higher Levels.</strong> You can choose an additional target for each slot level above 1st.</p>",
